 5187, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4264, "last_played": 1777136395, "avatar": "676a44065ac0dc779f0147fe5a6b160f3d4ce7e4"}, "language": "english", "review": "- A very good game starting from tutorial (the best one, I've ever seen) till finishing game at the hardest difficulty (no spoilers). \r\n- Several robots with uniquie abilities, perks and gameplay.\r\n- Tons of weapons to fulfill everyones' taste, my favourite ones are Kunai, Bow, Revolver and Gorilla. A small drawback is that there are few \"summon weapons\" among them, there are only 4 of them offered.\r\n- Game is fun both alone and with your friend.\r\n- Last but not least is the electronic soundtrack in the game, which is a masterice IMO.\r\nA must play if you like fast FPS games, or/and rogue-likes.", "timestamp_created": 1753825296, "timestamp_updated": 1753825296, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}